WEBVTT

00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:17,200
Is Dox gelatine that contains glycine a good thing for me to take if so how much and how often

00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:24,200
So this was asked by a person with breast cancer and I would answer no

00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:31,200
It's probably not a good thing for you to take. First of all dox brand gelatine. It's probably highly processed

00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:34,200
It's probably not a good source as a nutrient

00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:42,200
Now there may be some books out there especially older books that will say take dox gelatine. It's really good as a source of

00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:48,200
Collagen for your nails and your skin and your hair and such you're just better off taking a good clean source

00:00:48,200 --> 00:00:54,200
Collagen if that's what you're looking for I wouldn't use dox gelatine as a supplement no

